TITLE Mixing DIC and Ca solutions with calcite, heating 20-200C

SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    pH 7 charge

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    pH 7 charge

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 2
    Calcite 0 0

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_calcite.sel
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite

END
